WEBVTT

00:09:59.636 --> 00:10:01.796
was definitely a first in Germany.

00:10:01.836 --> 00:10:07.596
The numbers more than doubled:
28,000 people applied this time.

00:10:07.596 --> 00:10:08.996
And the German president --

00:10:08.996 --> 00:10:11.316
you see him here
in the center of the picture --

00:10:11.356 --> 00:10:12.916
became our patron.

00:10:12.956 --> 00:10:19.316
And so, thousands of Germans met again
in the summer of 2018

00:10:19.356 --> 00:10:21.676
to talk to someone else
with a different opinion.

00:10:21.676 --> 00:10:25.356
Some of the pairs we invited
to Berlin to a special event.

00:10:25.396 --> 00:10:27.356
And there, this picture was taken,

00:10:27.396 --> 00:10:31.556
until today my favorite symbol
for "Germany Talks."